WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.410 --> 00:00:03.110
Unit thirteen. Your Digital Footprint!

2
00:00:04.036 --> 00:00:07.797
Hello, everyone! I'm Doctor Visal, your school doctor.

3
00:00:07.847 --> 00:00:11.054
Hi, Doctor Visal! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.104 --> 00:00:14.833
Today we learn about Your Digital Footprint. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.592 --> 00:00:19.609
Digital footprint. Say it with me. Digital footprint!

6
00:00:23.076 --> 00:00:26.526
Post. Say it with me. Post!

7
00:00:30.004 --> 00:00:33.170
Privacy. Say it with me. Privacy!

8
00:00:36.696 --> 00:00:39.896
Permanent. Say it with me. Permanent!

9
00:00:43.452 --> 00:00:47.252
Reputation. Say it with me. Reputation!

10
00:00:50.742 --> 00:00:53.959
Settings. Say it with me. Settings!

11
00:00:57.419 --> 00:01:00.286
Think. Say it with me. Think!

12
00:01:03.774 --> 00:01:06.557
Share. Say it with me. Share!

13
00:01:10.040 --> 00:01:18.055
Everything I post creates a digital footprint that can be permanent. It can affect my reputation. I check privacy settings and think before I share.

14
00:01:18.105 --> 00:01:20.846
Now I understand. Thank you, Doctor Visal!

15
00:01:22.438 --> 00:01:27.499
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:27.549 --> 00:01:28.699
Privacy!

17
00:01:29.676 --> 00:01:34.652
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:34.702 --> 00:01:35.852
Think!

19
00:01:36.588 --> 00:01:41.939
Did you know? Screenshots mean even 'disappearing' messages can be saved and shared!

20
00:01:41.989 --> 00:01:43.767
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:44.493 --> 00:01:51.947
Think and answer. What should you ask yourself before posting?

22
00:01:51.997 --> 00:01:53.147
Great answer!

23
00:01:54.234 --> 00:01:58.738
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:01:58.788 --> 00:02:01.346
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

